/*  Description   : Reads arguments from a configuration file                */
/*                                                                           */
/*                                                                           */
/*  Inputs        : ps_app_ctx  : Application context                        */
/*                  fp_cfg_file : Configuration file handle                  */
/*  Globals       :                                                          */
